Feature: slice-2 / pricing-page
Branch: feat/web-app-slice-2
Verified: 2026-05-28
Anchored to: docs/18 §8.1 ("Pricing — Trial/SOLO/PRO/CLINIC, read from subscription_plans")

What was built
==============
- New route: `/pricing` (PL) and `/en/pricing` — both pre-rendered as
  SSG at build time.
- New helper: `src/lib/billing/plans.ts` — typed plan catalog mirroring
  migration 000029. `getPlanCatalog()` returns the rows; the comment
  inside flags the exact one-line swap point where
  `billingClient.listSubscriptionPlans({})` will plug in once that RPC
  ships (open question: it doesn't exist in proto yet — deliberate
  scope deferral, see "Known gaps" below).
- New component: `src/components/marketing/PricingCards.tsx` — client
  component (needs useState for the cycle toggle). Renders four cards
  side-by-side at lg breakpoint:
    Trial (free, always shown)
    Solo (monthly/annual)
    Pro (highlighted with Ember outline + glow + MOST POPULAR badge)
    Clinic (CTA targets /register/organization, not /register/therapist)
  Monthly/Annual toggle is a real tablist with role="tablist" + aria.
- New route file: `src/app/[locale]/pricing/page.tsx` — server
  component, awaits `getPlanCatalog()` server-side and hands the rows
  to the client tile component as props.
- i18n: `pricing` namespace added to messages/{pl,en}.json — cycle
  labels, tier names+taglines+features (5 each)+CTA labels, VAT note,
  unit labels (zł/miesiąc, PLN/month), free-tier label.
- Prices formatted via `Intl.NumberFormat` with the active locale
  (pl-PL or en-GB) — pl-PL gives "149" with no fractional digits;
  en-GB matches the design's no-decimals choice. Both currencies are
  PLN per docs/18 (subscription_plans.currency_code).

How verified
============
1. `pnpm build` exit 0. Route table now lists `/[locale]/pricing`
   with pre-rendered /pl/pricing + /en/pricing alongside the existing
   /[locale] home routes — 7 static pages total, all generated.

2. Live HTTP smoke:
     curl http://localhost:3000/pricing       → 200
     curl http://localhost:3000/en/pricing    → 200

3. Puppeteer screenshots:
   - pricing-pl-{mobile,tablet,desktop}.png — viewport-clipped views,
     Polish locale. Mobile (375): cards stack 1-up; tablet (768):
     2-col grid; desktop (1280): 4-col grid with Pro card highlighted
     and badged.
   - pricing-en-{mobile,tablet,desktop}.png — same dimensions, EN
     copy throughout: "Trial", "Solo", "Pro" (with "Most popular"
     badge), "Clinic".
   - pricing-pl-full.png + pricing-en-full.png — fullPage shots
     captured via scripts/snap-full.mjs. Show the entire page
     composition: Navbar → hero block ("Plan dopasowany do Twojej
     praktyki" / "A plan that fits your practice") → monthly/annual
     toggle → 4 plan cards → VAT note → footer.

4. Visual confirmation (every screenshot opened with Read):
   - PL pricing: nav highlights nothing special (Cennik link is in
     navbar but page handles its own h1). Headings/subhead in Polish
     with diacritics. All four cards show Polish copy. Pro card has
     "NAJPOPULARNIEJSZY" badge (Ember on Obsidian).
   - EN pricing: heading "A plan that fits your practice", Pro card
     has "MOST POPULAR" badge, English feature bullets.
   - Pricing rows match migration 000029 exactly:
       Solo Monthly  → 149 PLN / 20 sessions
       Pro  Monthly  → 249 PLN / 40 sessions
       Clinic Monthly → 999 PLN / 150 sessions
     (Annual values would be 1490 / 2490 / 9990 — verifiable by
     toggling the cycle, not captured in static screenshot but the
     code in plans.ts maps the rows directly.)

5. `preview_console_logs(level=error)` returns "No console logs" —
   the new client component renders cleanly.

6. i18n parity: PL + EN messages added in lockstep (same key shape
   under `pricing.*`). Any future translation drift gets caught by
   the parity script that lands in Slice 6.

Compliance with docs/18
=======================
- ✓ §8.1: pricing page lists Trial / SOLO / PRO / CLINIC.
- ✓ §14.5: every visible string is a translation key. The only
  inline literal is the "✓" feature bullet (decorative, not copy).
- ✓ Currency formatting via Intl.NumberFormat per docs/18 §14.6.
- ✓ Clinic CTA targets /register/organization (org founders);
  Trial / Solo / Pro CTAs target /register/therapist (individual).
  Routing aligned with §6.1 single-role MVP.

Known gaps (deferred)
=====================
- NO ListSubscriptionPlans RPC on billing-svc yet. The pricing page
  consumes a STATIC catalog (`PLANS` const in plans.ts) sourced from
  the migration. This is pragmatic, not principled — when the RPC
  lands, swap getPlanCatalog() in one place. Verification.log notes
  the one-line swap point. Trade-off: plan-price changes now require
  a code deploy alongside the DB UPDATE (vs. DB-only with a live
  RPC). The catalog rarely changes; acceptable.
- /register/{therapist,organization} land in Slice 3. CTAs link out
  but the destinations 404 today.

